      "title": "Letterboxd review of We Are Little Zombies",
      "snippet": "[Letterboxd Review of \"We Are Little Zombies\"] It's an onslaught of digital novelties, but Nagahisa's day-glo candy wrapper conceals the desensitization of the terminally online. There's anger beneath the gloss: the story of four orphaned children hyped into pop stardom, their emotional numbness the media hook. If that seems a stretch and the provocation too emo-kitsch, it's also an experiment that's daring and fresh.",
