      "snippet": "[Letterboxd Review of \"We Are Little Zombies\"] Never thought I'd be laughing at the death of a kid's parents but here we are. Um, thanks Japan?Four kids brought together by the untimely deaths of their parents. They're all seemingly emotionless and unsure how to grieve, so they hang out and travel around, eventually forming a band, which is partly where the movie title comes from. Their misadventures are complimented with retro chiptunes and video-gamish scenes that open up heaps of cute creativity.I saw the trailer for this a few years back, and a comment or part of a review had mentioned Kamikaze Girls, so I figured this would be an easy",
